Yes. Unique turns a kind into an individual. Indeed, Ropno Gugde
is to Hungary as John is to John-here-and-now.

Where squinting comes in, is if you normally see many different
individuals that are instances of the same kind. Squinting is
the process of seeing those different individual as the same
individual, so that the distinction between kind and individual
is erased.

